TechMart Hardware Warranty Terms:
- Standard 1-Year Limited Manufacturer Warranty covers manufacturing defects, battery failures, and screen flickering.
- TechCare+ Extended Warranty ($4.99/mo) includes accidental damage protection and zero-deductible advance replacement (RMA).
